%description:
Tests that the ICMPv6 Packet Too Big message is still delivered to the
transport layer after the ~Ipv6 module has taken the reported MTU out of it
for its own path MTU cache.

NClientsEth example network is used (cli -- r1 -- r2 -- r3 -- srv).
The r2-r3 link has a reduced MTU (1400 bytes), and the client runs a TCP bulk
transfer with `pmtudEnabled` turned on and an MSS large enough to overflow that
link. Both layers must react to the same Packet Too Big: ~Ipv6 caches the
1400-byte path MTU, and ~Tcp lowers snd_mss to 1400 - 40 (IPv6 header) - 20
(TCP header) = 1340 bytes.

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = ../../../../examples;../../../../src
network = inet.examples.ipv6.nclients.NClientsEth
sim-time-limit = 30s
cmdenv-express-mode = false
cmdenv-log-prefix = "%C: "

# number of client computers
*.n = 1

# Reduce MTU on r2's interface toward r3 to trigger Packet Too Big
*.r2.eth[1].*.mtu = 1400B

# TCP Path MTU Discovery (RFC 8201) on the client
**.tcp.mss = 1400
**.cli[*].tcp.pmtudEnabled = true

**.cli[*].numApps = 1
**.cli[*].app[0].typename = "TcpSessionApp"
**.cli[*].app[0].connectAddress = "srv"
**.cli[*].app[0].connectPort = 1000
**.cli[*].app[0].tOpen = 10s
**.cli[*].app[0].tSend = 10.5s
**.cli[*].app[0].sendBytes = 50000B
**.cli[*].app[0].tClose = 25s

**.srv.numApps = 1
**.srv.app[0].typename = "TcpSinkApp"
**.srv.app[0].localPort = 1000

# Ethernet NIC configuration
**.eth[*].queue.typename = "EthernetQosQueue"
**.eth[*].queue.dataQueue.typename = "DropTailQueue" # in routers
**.eth[*].queue.dataQueue.packetCapacity = 10  # in routers

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%subst: /omnetpp:://
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%# the network layer learns the path MTU ...
%contains-regex: stdout
NClientsEth\.cli\[0\]\.ipv6\.routingTable: Path MTU for .* reduced to 1400
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%# ... and the same indication still reaches TCP, which lowers its MSS
%contains-regex: stdout
PMTUD: reducing snd_mss from \d+ to 1340 \(reported MTU=1400\)
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
